WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:36.600
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:36.870 --> 01:38.850
[The Lament of Autumn]

3
01:39.470 --> 01:41.640
[Episode 1]

4
01:44.259 --> 01:45.930
[8th Year of Republic of China]

5
01:45.930 --> 01:47.640
[Hundreds of thousands of young men]

6
01:47.640 --> 01:50.259
[defined patriotism with passion.]

7
01:50.759 --> 01:53.650
[This revolutionary spirit is like a guiding light in the darkness.]

8
01:50.800 --> 01:51.330
[Civil war ruins a nation; peace builds a nation]

9
01:51.430 --> 01:52.930
[Da Feng Bank]

10
01:53.039 --> 01:54.620
[Nanhuai]

11
01:53.920 --> 01:56.450
[It lights up the gates to a new era of China.]

12
01:57.000 --> 01:58.350
[At the end of the same year,]

13
01:58.350 --> 02:00.200
[the acting president died of illness.]

14
02:00.200 --> 02:02.280
[The leader of the northern warlords, Cheng Jun,]

15
02:02.280 --> 02:04.340
[plotted to assume the presidency,]

16
02:04.590 --> 02:07.850
[and proposed the idea of a coalition to various regions.]

17
02:08.130 --> 02:09.910
[In an era of clashing ideologies]

18
02:08.169 --> 02:11.850
[Yu]

19
02:10.130 --> 02:12.060
[and power struggles,]

20
02:12.310 --> 02:13.910
[the old gives way to the new]

21
02:14.080 --> 02:16.210
[and light and darkness intertwine.]

22
02:16.240 --> 02:18.370
The Commander-in-Chief has arrived!

23
02:25.500 --> 02:27.430
Greetings, Commander-in-Chief!

24
02:37.110 --> 02:39.680
[Nanhuai Army Headquarters]

25
02:38.900 --> 02:39.760
As you all know,

26
02:40.430 --> 02:42.530
Third Master Cheng and Premier Rui

27
02:42.530 --> 02:44.390
are fighting for the presidency.

28
02:44.530 --> 02:46.740
Military Governor Chu is his direct subordinate,

29
02:46.740 --> 02:47.910
so of course he agreed.

30
02:47.910 --> 02:50.950
[Yu]

31
02:48.740 --> 02:49.780
But Commander Mou

32
02:50.340 --> 02:51.470
politely declined.

33
02:52.590 --> 02:54.240
Regarding the coalition,

34
02:55.860 --> 02:57.130
what do you all think?

35
03:00.360 --> 03:01.970
The Mou family has been growing stronger these years.

36
03:01.970 --> 03:03.030
Their wings have hardened,

37
03:03.030 --> 03:06.960
and they now want to stand on equal footing with Military Governor Chu.

38
03:07.090 --> 03:08.280
In my opinion,

39
03:08.900 --> 03:11.280
Premier Rui has been at the helm of the central government for many years

40
03:11.280 --> 03:12.500
and has deep roots there.

41
03:12.450 --> 03:15.000
[Yu]

42
03:13.750 --> 03:15.370
As for this Third Master Cheng,

43
03:15.370 --> 03:17.900
he was just a destitute man in his early years,

44
03:18.079 --> 03:19.940
making a living by selling cloth.

45
03:20.340 --> 03:21.460
Later, he relied on

46
03:21.460 --> 03:22.910
that old monkey, Mr. Wu,

47
03:23.060 --> 03:24.180
to make his fortune.

48
03:24.180 --> 03:26.130
With such a foundation,

49
03:26.930 --> 03:28.930
how can he compete with Premier Rui?

50
03:30.150 --> 03:31.750
We may have our own concerns,

51
03:33.340 --> 03:35.150
but we are all just afraid of betting on the wrong person

52
03:35.150 --> 03:36.480
and losing our capital.

53
03:36.650 --> 03:38.800
But the current central government

54
03:39.150 --> 03:41.800
is already a revolving door.

55
03:42.060 --> 03:44.060
If we just watch from the sidelines,

56
03:44.650 --> 03:47.110
I'm afraid there will be no seats left for us.

57
03:48.060 --> 03:49.650
In this great game of life,

58
03:50.400 --> 03:51.740
if you don't make a move,

59
03:52.750 --> 03:54.460
you will never win.

60
03:55.079 --> 03:56.090
I think...

61
03:57.900 --> 03:59.000
this risk

62
03:59.530 --> 04:00.650
is worth taking.

63
04:08.210 --> 04:09.810
We don't need to be too conservative.

64
04:09.810 --> 04:10.590
What's going on?

65
04:10.590 --> 04:12.190
Where did this bird come from?

66
04:12.190 --> 04:13.340
What's going on?

67
04:14.090 --> 04:14.750
Commander,

68
04:15.000 --> 04:15.960
this is the parrot raised by

69
04:15.960 --> 04:17.420
Fifth Young Master in the office.

70
04:17.420 --> 04:18.680
How absrud.

71
04:18.680 --> 04:20.500
Yes, it's ridiculous.

72
04:21.060 --> 04:22.930
Tell him to come see me immediately.

73
04:22.930 --> 04:23.660
Commander,

74
04:24.330 --> 04:25.560
Fifth Young Master asked for leave

75
04:25.560 --> 04:28.160
and hasn't been in the army these past few days.

76
04:28.930 --> 04:30.250
That scoundrel!

77
04:33.030 --> 04:34.890
[Xiangxi Hotel]

78
04:39.560 --> 04:40.560
This way, please.

79
04:41.830 --> 04:44.159
Open! Open! Open!

80
05:02.740 --> 05:05.270
Fifth Young Master Yu's luck has been so good!

81
05:05.640 --> 05:07.640
Yes, he's completely unstoppable.

82
05:16.000 --> 05:17.860
Thank you, Fifth Young Master Yu.

83
05:18.240 --> 05:18.950
Yes.

84
05:22.040 --> 05:22.830
Game!

85
05:23.470 --> 05:25.400
Great luck, Fifth Young Master Yu!

86
05:26.040 --> 05:27.840
Winning just this much is no fun.

87
05:27.950 --> 05:30.090
I'll pay all three of you this round.

88
05:30.660 --> 05:32.540
I'll double whatever you lost.

89
05:32.980 --> 05:33.970
Great!

90
05:34.100 --> 05:35.390
How generous, Fifth Young Master Yu!

91
05:35.390 --> 05:37.070
Come, come!

92
05:39.010 --> 05:39.680
See that?

93
05:40.250 --> 05:42.780
Now that’s what I call a broad-minded person!

94
05:42.909 --> 05:43.960
If you ask me,

95
05:44.070 --> 05:45.659
with the Fifth Young Master Yu's luck,

96
05:45.659 --> 05:46.300
in addition to

97
05:46.300 --> 05:48.010
this grand spectacle today,

98
05:48.120 --> 05:49.120
let alone us

99
05:49.120 --> 05:50.010
playing cards together,

100
05:50.010 --> 05:51.010
no matter who you bring in,

101
05:51.010 --> 05:51.810
they'd lose everything they have.

102
05:51.810 --> 05:52.180
Believe it or not?

103
05:52.180 --> 05:53.120
I believe, I believe.

104
05:53.120 --> 05:54.180
He is unstoppable.

105
05:56.180 --> 05:57.159
A useless card.

106
05:57.659 --> 05:58.920
I'll let you guys pong.

107
05:59.510 --> 06:00.010
Pong?

108
06:02.060 --> 06:03.260
Here in Nanhuai City,

109
06:03.370 --> 06:05.330
being able to play a round of mahjong with Fifth Young Master Yu

110
06:05.330 --> 06:07.630
is an honor earned over several lifetimes.

111
06:07.630 --> 06:08.470
Absolutely.

112
06:09.130 --> 06:10.510
Speaking of which,

113
06:10.830 --> 06:11.920
I have a cousin

114
06:12.190 --> 06:14.250
who has worked in the logistics department for 5 years.

115
06:14.250 --> 06:15.860
He's very honest

116
06:16.190 --> 06:18.100
and has always wanted to transfer to the transportation department.

117
06:18.100 --> 06:19.760
He just lacks an opportunity.

118
06:20.160 --> 06:21.760
I hope the Fifth Young Master

119
06:21.770 --> 06:22.560
can help him out.

120
06:22.560 --> 06:24.220
What's the use of coming to me?

121
06:24.510 --> 06:26.120
I just happen to be with the staff department,

122
06:26.120 --> 06:27.450
holding an empty title.

123
06:27.500 --> 06:29.000
Look at what you're saying.

124
06:29.000 --> 06:29.390
You are

125
06:29.390 --> 06:31.450
the crown prince of our Nanhuai City.

126
06:33.270 --> 06:34.370
Fifth Young Master Yu,

127
06:34.370 --> 06:35.659
next Wednesday evening,

128
06:35.659 --> 06:37.730
my uncle's bank is hosting a banquet.

129
06:37.980 --> 06:40.060
I beg you to do us the honor of taking the main seat.

130
06:40.060 --> 06:41.790
You just have to show your face.

131
07:03.310 --> 07:07.680
[Yu’s Residence]

132
07:06.740 --> 07:07.500
Mingxuan.

133
07:07.740 --> 07:14.130
[Memorial Tablet of Beloved Son, Yu Mingxuan]

134
07:08.540 --> 07:09.770
It's getting cold.

135
07:10.500 --> 07:12.040
I am burning you

136
07:12.390 --> 07:14.070
a hat and a scarf.

137
07:14.500 --> 07:15.830
Remember to put them on.

138
07:18.180 --> 07:20.680
I went to Tianjin Street today

139
07:21.870 --> 07:23.680
and bought your favorite

140
07:24.330 --> 07:25.260
tangerine cake.

141
07:27.100 --> 07:28.360
After all these years,

142
07:29.540 --> 07:31.740
nothing has changed on Tianjin Street.

143
07:32.570 --> 07:34.190
Only my son

144
07:35.810 --> 07:36.870
is gone.

145
07:50.610 --> 07:53.159
[The Lotus Sutra]

146
07:52.330 --> 07:53.659
Rest assured, brother.

147
07:53.680 --> 07:55.480
As a son-in-law of the Yu family,

148
07:56.070 --> 07:58.670
I will definitely take good care of the family.

149
08:29.480 --> 08:30.740
Changxuan, slow down!

150
08:31.630 --> 08:32.760
Fifth Young Master!

151
08:32.820 --> 08:34.549
Fifth Young Master, are you alright?

152
08:34.549 --> 08:35.210
Stop there!

153
08:38.480 --> 08:39.080
Come in!

154
08:50.500 --> 08:51.500
Everyone's here?

155
08:52.890 --> 08:54.790
What is that on your cheek?

156
08:58.290 --> 08:59.820
That's a woman's lipstick!

157
09:00.720 --> 09:02.110
All you do every day

158
09:02.290 --> 09:03.370
is to fool around,

159
09:03.650 --> 09:04.870
eat, drink, and play.

160
09:05.000 --> 09:05.960
What a disgrace!

161
09:06.410 --> 09:07.000
Zhou Tai!

162
09:07.120 --> 09:07.650
I'm here.

163
09:07.840 --> 09:08.620
Bring the family cane.

164
09:08.620 --> 09:09.170
Yes.

165
09:11.000 --> 09:12.460
No need to bother.

166
09:12.910 --> 09:14.770
You just want to hit me, don't you?

167
09:15.290 --> 09:16.240
Come on.

168
09:17.750 --> 09:19.700
If he hadn't lost two sons,

169
09:20.960 --> 09:23.220
he would have beaten me to death long ago.

170
09:34.500 --> 09:35.230
Dad!

171
09:38.000 --> 09:38.410
Dad!

172
09:38.410 --> 09:39.670
Don't hit him!

173
09:39.670 --> 09:41.220
Your hand has no sense of moderation.

174
09:41.220 --> 09:42.240
If you hurt him,

175
09:42.240 --> 09:43.200
I won't live either.

176
09:43.200 --> 09:43.600
Get up!

177
09:43.620 --> 09:44.750
-Carry on! -No!

178
09:44.790 --> 09:45.360
I'll beat you to death!

179
09:45.360 --> 09:46.570
I'm never letting you off!

180
09:46.570 --> 09:48.250
Don't!

181
09:49.100 --> 09:49.720
Get up!

182
09:50.320 --> 09:51.480
Mom! Mom!

183
09:52.120 --> 09:54.470
Stop hitting him, Yu Zhongquan!

184
09:54.520 --> 09:56.940
I had three sons, and two are dead.

185
09:57.010 --> 09:59.410
This is my only remaining heir.

186
09:59.500 --> 10:00.410
Let him go!

187
10:00.460 --> 10:01.720
If you beat him to death,

188
10:01.720 --> 10:04.480
you'll truly be all alone!

189
10:11.010 --> 10:12.210
It's okay, don't cry.

190
10:12.790 --> 10:13.600
Commander.

191
10:14.000 --> 10:14.700
Stop hitting him.

192
10:14.700 --> 10:16.300
Look, Wanxuan is terrified.

193
10:16.700 --> 10:18.120
Why are you all just standing there?

194
10:18.120 --> 10:19.580
Hurry up and get him back to his room!

195
10:19.580 --> 10:20.500
Hurry, hurry.

196
10:21.500 --> 10:22.030
Let's go.

197
10:42.200 --> 10:43.200
Bear with it.

198
10:43.700 --> 10:45.200
Just bear a while more.

199
10:48.460 --> 10:50.290
I worked so hard

200
10:50.580 --> 10:52.290
to raise three sons,

201
10:52.650 --> 10:54.500
and now only this one is left.

202
10:56.790 --> 10:58.550
Mom, don't be sad anymore.

203
10:59.050 --> 11:00.710
Here's some bruise ointment.

204
11:07.510 --> 11:08.620
Bear with it.

205
11:15.790 --> 11:17.250
It's also hard on Minru.

206
11:19.390 --> 11:22.590
She had only been married into the Yu family for two months

207
11:23.250 --> 11:25.100
when Mingxuan died in battle.

208
11:29.000 --> 11:30.660
The Yu family has let you down.

209
11:32.050 --> 11:33.360
I know well in my heart.

210
11:35.460 --> 11:36.120
Mom,

211
11:36.820 --> 11:38.030
since I am married into the Yu family,

212
11:38.030 --> 11:39.530
I am therefore a member of the Yu family.

213
11:39.530 --> 11:40.320
There is no such thing

214
11:40.320 --> 11:41.380
as letting me down.

215
11:42.200 --> 11:44.000
I know you care about Changxuan,

216
11:44.390 --> 11:45.050
but...

217
11:45.220 --> 11:45.790
you also need to take good care

218
11:45.790 --> 11:46.850
of your own health.

219
11:47.700 --> 11:48.390
Say no more.

220
11:50.200 --> 11:50.750
Mom,

221
11:51.390 --> 11:54.250
frankly, Changxuan deserves to be taught a lesson.

222
11:54.250 --> 11:56.110
Look at Xiao Beichen from Beixin.

223
11:56.120 --> 11:58.010
He's only a year or two older than him,

224
11:58.010 --> 12:00.050
but on the battlefield, he is a brilliant strategist

225
12:00.050 --> 12:01.110
who is invincible.

226
12:01.910 --> 12:03.240
Then look at Changxuan.

227
12:03.410 --> 12:04.870
What a good-for-nothing!

228
12:05.410 --> 12:07.200
Yu Qixuan, can you get out?

229
12:07.290 --> 12:08.600
Your voice annoys me.

230
12:09.820 --> 12:10.880
Exactly.

231
12:11.100 --> 12:12.880
Why do you always compare others

232
12:12.880 --> 12:15.090
with your own brother?

233
12:15.600 --> 12:17.060
He has a headache. Get out.

234
12:17.600 --> 12:18.400
Fine, I'll go.

235
12:18.600 --> 12:20.730
I'm considered annoying here anyway.

236
12:22.120 --> 12:23.290
Mom, I'm fine.

237
12:23.410 --> 12:24.010
Just go.

238
12:24.010 --> 12:25.200
All of you go.

239
12:25.200 --> 12:26.000
Okay, okay.

240
12:26.000 --> 12:27.430
We'll all leave. Let's go.

241
12:27.430 --> 12:28.020
Come.

242
12:29.390 --> 12:31.720
Come find me quickly if anything happens.

243
12:45.050 --> 12:45.700
Ruitong.

244
12:47.870 --> 12:48.870
Get the car ready.

245
12:59.820 --> 13:00.620
Commander.

246
13:02.700 --> 13:03.910
Please calm down.

247
13:07.010 --> 13:07.910
No need.

248
13:08.890 --> 13:10.720
I haven't lost my mind from anger.

249
13:10.720 --> 13:13.000
At that critical moment,

250
13:13.000 --> 13:14.930
Wanxuan suddenly started crying.

251
13:15.500 --> 13:17.100
You pinched her, didn't you?

252
13:19.240 --> 13:21.170
I just didn't want you to get angry.

253
13:23.010 --> 13:23.860
I know.

254
13:24.460 --> 13:26.910
It's perfectly justified for you to discipline Changxuan.

255
13:26.910 --> 13:28.100
Being strict with him

256
13:28.100 --> 13:29.360
is for his own good.

257
13:30.220 --> 13:32.620
But you shouldn't ruin your health over it.

258
13:32.650 --> 13:33.910
After all, this family

259
13:34.290 --> 13:36.150
relies on you to hold it together.

260
13:54.840 --> 13:55.500
Changxuan.

261
13:58.340 --> 13:59.750
The rain is getting heavier.

262
13:59.750 --> 14:00.670
The mountain road to Guanyin Pavilion

263
14:00.670 --> 14:02.230
might be challenging to travel on.

264
14:02.230 --> 14:02.860
Are we still going to

265
14:02.860 --> 14:04.660
pay respects to Mingxuan today?

266
14:12.820 --> 14:13.460
Forget it.

267
14:14.000 --> 14:14.800
Let's go back.

268
14:17.000 --> 14:17.730
Turn around.

269
14:26.910 --> 14:27.770
What happened?

270
14:28.500 --> 14:30.160
Someone suddenly rushed out.

271
14:30.320 --> 14:31.180
Did we hit them?

272
14:32.530 --> 14:33.460
I don't think so.

273
14:35.090 --> 14:38.220
But she seems to have dropped things all over the ground.

274
14:43.940 --> 14:44.670
5.

275
14:50.200 --> 14:51.200
6.

276
14:53.670 --> 14:54.600
7.

277
15:00.370 --> 15:01.340
8.

278
15:05.360 --> 15:06.200
9.

279
15:13.360 --> 15:14.120
10.

280
15:43.360 --> 15:44.000
Thank you.

281
16:27.760 --> 16:29.150
[Mingde Girls' High School]

282
16:33.620 --> 16:34.550
[Jiguang Tower, Mingde Girls' High School]

283
16:43.240 --> 16:44.130
Xueting.

284
16:44.820 --> 16:47.220
Mother and I are both looking forward to late autumn,

285
16:47.220 --> 16:49.620
when you return from your studies in Tokyo.

286
16:49.890 --> 16:52.740
We've kept in touch through letters these past 4 years.

287
16:52.740 --> 16:54.910
It’s as if it were you, the one who grew up with me,

288
16:54.910 --> 16:56.180
never went far away.

289
17:03.620 --> 17:04.420
Pingjun!

290
17:08.460 --> 17:09.369
Slow down.

291
17:09.400 --> 17:09.849
Here.

292
17:10.740 --> 17:11.550
Take these.

293
17:12.480 --> 17:13.339
Hold on to them.

294
17:13.440 --> 17:14.140
When I get home,

295
17:14.140 --> 17:16.140
I'll ask my father for a little more.

296
17:16.310 --> 17:17.810
No, I can't accept this.

297
17:17.880 --> 17:19.960
I can't always rely on your financial support.

298
17:19.960 --> 17:21.609
Why are you acting like a stranger?

299
17:21.609 --> 17:22.920
Your mother's lung disease has flared up,

300
17:22.920 --> 17:24.510
and this is exactly when you need money the most.

301
17:24.510 --> 17:25.640
Hurry up and take it.

302
17:26.030 --> 17:28.109
Then when I find a job,

303
17:28.240 --> 17:29.240
I'll pay you back.

304
17:30.700 --> 17:31.830
I'll get going then.

305
17:31.880 --> 17:32.530
Take care.

306
18:06.290 --> 18:11.060
[Da Hua Department Store]

307
18:11.830 --> 18:12.790
The next item

308
18:12.980 --> 18:14.380
is the highlight

309
18:14.530 --> 18:16.200
of this auction.

310
18:17.880 --> 18:19.210
Everyone, please look.

311
18:25.290 --> 18:26.370
This piece of jewelry

312
18:26.370 --> 18:27.030
was once collected by

313
18:27.030 --> 18:28.880
a Russian duchess.

314
18:29.070 --> 18:31.610
Even after a century, it remains dazzling.

315
18:31.830 --> 18:32.380
Now,

316
18:32.570 --> 18:33.830
let the bidding begin.

317
18:34.030 --> 18:34.570
Miss Tao,

318
18:35.380 --> 18:36.180
do you like it?

319
18:37.270 --> 18:38.070
It's alright.

320
18:39.240 --> 18:40.590
Miss Tao, if you like it,

321
18:40.980 --> 18:42.380
how about I bid it for you?

322
18:47.290 --> 18:47.900
Ziyi.

323
18:48.530 --> 18:49.790
This guy surnamed Tong

324
18:50.270 --> 18:52.980
is all show with no substance.

325
18:53.530 --> 18:55.180
He said he went to study abroad,

326
18:55.180 --> 18:57.070
but he didn't learn any real skills.

327
18:57.070 --> 18:59.730
Instead, he became an expert in all things vice.

328
19:00.140 --> 19:01.800
The starting price is 50,000.

329
19:02.140 --> 19:03.220
Let the bidding begin.

330
19:03.220 --> 19:03.850
60,000.

331
19:04.270 --> 19:06.030
Mr. Tong bids 60,000.

332
19:06.290 --> 19:07.050
100,000.

333
19:07.940 --> 19:08.740
110,000.

334
19:09.140 --> 19:09.850
140,000.

335
19:09.980 --> 19:10.790
160,000.

336
19:11.090 --> 19:11.850
400,000.

337
19:13.240 --> 19:13.920
400,000.

338
19:14.440 --> 19:15.640
The bid is at 400,000!

339
19:17.000 --> 19:18.180
Any higher bids?

340
19:20.850 --> 19:21.750
450,000!

341
19:22.350 --> 19:23.160
400...

342
19:23.290 --> 19:24.440
450,000!

343
19:28.050 --> 19:29.420
450,000 going once.

344
19:30.290 --> 19:32.130
450,000 going twice.

345
19:32.500 --> 19:33.640
450,000...

346
19:34.590 --> 19:35.390
going thrice!

347
19:36.240 --> 19:37.250
Congratulations, Mr. Tong,

348
19:37.250 --> 19:38.450
on winning this item!

349
19:43.550 --> 19:44.480
What's the rush?

350
19:58.980 --> 20:00.510
It's Fifth Young Master Yu.

351
20:20.190 --> 20:21.390
What did I tell you?

352
20:21.750 --> 20:22.950
Knowing you're here,

353
20:23.090 --> 20:25.090
Yu Changxuan would definitely come.

354
20:25.090 --> 20:25.940
Fifth Young Master Yu,

355
20:25.940 --> 20:26.670
you're here.

356
20:26.980 --> 20:28.440
This item looks good.

357
20:29.400 --> 20:31.200
This item has already been sold.

358
20:31.790 --> 20:33.050
There are better ones coming up.

359
20:33.050 --> 20:34.850
Would you mind looking at those?

360
20:35.900 --> 20:37.030
Isn't that simple?

361
20:38.160 --> 20:39.690
Put it up for auction again.

362
20:42.000 --> 20:43.260
Fifth Young Master Yu,

363
20:43.900 --> 20:45.500
we have rules to follow here.

364
20:46.030 --> 20:47.490
Since I've already won it,

365
20:47.550 --> 20:50.010
how can you simply ask to have it auctioned again?

366
20:50.010 --> 20:51.810
Aren't you being too demanding?

367
21:06.920 --> 21:08.320
What exactly do you want?

368
21:09.700 --> 21:12.250
I heard Mr. Tong just returned from studying abroad.

369
21:12.250 --> 21:13.010
No wonder.

370
21:15.050 --> 21:16.090
In Nanhuai City,

371
21:17.220 --> 21:17.830
I've never seen

372
21:17.830 --> 21:19.090
anyone as gutsy as you.

373
21:19.900 --> 21:20.760
So I've decided

374
21:22.420 --> 21:23.610
to auction off

375
21:25.350 --> 21:26.490
your pride today.

376
21:33.480 --> 21:35.210
Auctioning me off like an item?

377
21:35.720 --> 21:36.980
Starting price is 500.

378
21:37.480 --> 21:38.740
Let the auction begin.

379
21:49.500 --> 21:51.240
So this is Xiangxi Hotel.

380
21:58.720 --> 22:00.360
Hello, do you need any help?

381
22:02.480 --> 22:04.830
Hello, I'm here for a job interview.

382
22:05.140 --> 22:06.270
Go up to the 2nd floor from here,

383
22:06.270 --> 22:07.570
walk to the end of the left corridor,

384
22:07.570 --> 22:08.740
then turn left with the crowd,

385
22:08.740 --> 22:09.180
and you'll see

386
22:09.180 --> 22:10.840
the office for the interview.

387
22:14.350 --> 22:15.420
Annoying.

388
22:18.590 --> 22:19.290
Hurry up.

389
22:19.480 --> 22:22.010
There are so many people interviewing today.

390
22:22.350 --> 22:23.400
I'm so nervous.

391
22:23.400 --> 22:25.250
Why are they hiring so few people?

392
22:25.250 --> 22:26.850
I heard they're look to hire only 4 people today.

393
22:26.850 --> 22:28.380
I've been waiting forever.

394
22:28.660 --> 22:30.700
[Recruitment Room]

395
22:29.900 --> 22:31.610
My father belongs to the Yu Army,

396
22:31.610 --> 22:33.500
1st Regiment, 2nd Brigade, 3rd Division.

397
22:33.500 --> 22:34.760
He's a platoon leader.

398
22:34.810 --> 22:36.270
Do you have any relatives

399
22:36.460 --> 22:38.050
serving in the military?

400
22:38.900 --> 22:39.500
My uncle

401
22:39.500 --> 22:41.560
works at the Secretariat of the Army.

402
22:42.220 --> 22:43.420
The Secretariat?

403
22:43.650 --> 22:45.310
[Xiangxi Hotel Interview Application] [Name: Zhou Yanchu]

404
22:45.720 --> 22:47.310
Your father passed away early,

405
22:47.310 --> 22:49.440
and you are only left with your mother?

406
22:50.790 --> 22:51.590
Yes.

407
22:51.610 --> 22:53.670
Does your family own any businesses?

408
22:53.700 --> 22:55.830
We don't own any as an ordinary family.

409
23:01.220 --> 23:02.660
I worked at a French restaurant

410
23:02.660 --> 23:03.660
for a year,

411
23:03.770 --> 23:05.420
mainly as a receptionist.

412
23:05.450 --> 23:06.610
I am fluent in

413
23:06.610 --> 23:07.700
English and French,

414
23:07.700 --> 23:09.530
know a bit about Western dining etiquette,

415
23:09.530 --> 23:11.530
and am quite familiar with Western cuisine.

416
23:11.530 --> 23:13.090
If you give me this job,

417
23:13.200 --> 23:15.000
I will do my absolute best.

418
23:24.460 --> 23:26.700
100. Any bids?

419
23:26.750 --> 23:28.610
100 is simply embarrassing.

420
23:28.630 --> 23:30.660
50. Any bids?

421
23:36.090 --> 23:38.770
40. Anyone?

422
23:39.480 --> 23:40.700
Who would dare to bid?

423
23:40.810 --> 23:43.610
That would be going against Fifth Young Master Yu.

424
23:46.350 --> 23:48.520
30. Any bids?

425
23:55.090 --> 23:57.550
1 dollar. Any bids?

426
23:57.610 --> 23:59.920
1 dollar? That is ridiculous.

427
23:59.920 --> 24:01.720
That's as good as giving it away.

428
24:02.290 --> 24:04.200
No one wants to buy it even for a dollar.

429
24:04.200 --> 24:05.180
I announce

430
24:05.700 --> 24:06.810
that with no bids,

431
24:07.220 --> 24:08.350
Mr. Tong's pride

432
24:10.110 --> 24:10.840
goes unsold.

433
24:31.290 --> 24:32.090
Pride

434
24:33.850 --> 24:35.720
is worthless to me.

435
24:38.310 --> 24:39.710
Can you just be obedient?

436
24:41.940 --> 24:42.380
Yes.

437
24:50.380 --> 24:51.790
Whatever he paid for it,

438
24:52.960 --> 24:54.220
I'll buy it for double.

439
24:56.240 --> 24:58.440
I heard a batch of whiskey just arrived.

440
24:58.570 --> 24:59.830
Yes, Fifth Young Master Yu.

441
24:59.830 --> 25:01.760
It just got shipped from Scotland.

442
25:02.510 --> 25:04.040
A bottle for everyone here.

443
25:04.480 --> 25:05.190
It's on me.

444
25:06.350 --> 25:08.410
How generous, Fifth Young Master Yu.

445
25:08.980 --> 25:10.840
Thank you, Fifth Young Master Yu!

446
25:19.880 --> 25:20.550
Hi!

447
25:21.660 --> 25:22.220
Hello.

448
25:22.980 --> 25:24.200
I'd like to know

449
25:24.240 --> 25:25.510
why I wasn't selected.

450
25:27.550 --> 25:29.080
Let me put it this way, miss.

451
25:29.570 --> 25:31.430
A person's outlook and worldview

452
25:31.440 --> 25:33.700
are related to one's family background.

453
25:33.920 --> 25:34.790
For example,

454
25:35.050 --> 25:36.400
take our hotel.

455
25:37.030 --> 25:39.070
We are the first hotel in the city

456
25:39.070 --> 25:41.270
to introduce indoor golf.

457
25:41.460 --> 25:42.610
This kind of western novelty,

458
25:42.610 --> 25:44.350
popular among foreign aristocrats,

459
25:44.350 --> 25:46.420
is something many people have never even seen.

460
25:46.420 --> 25:48.270
If you make a fool of yourself,

461
25:48.980 --> 25:50.710
people might not remember you,

462
25:50.920 --> 25:52.050
but they will definitely remember

463
25:52.050 --> 25:54.680
that it was Xiangxi Hotel's fault.

464
25:57.610 --> 25:59.850
Actually, golf

465
26:00.050 --> 26:00.590
originated from

466
26:00.590 --> 26:02.650
a game played by Scottish shepherds.

467
26:02.680 --> 26:04.240
While herding sheep,

468
26:04.310 --> 26:05.810
they used the handles of their crooks

469
26:05.810 --> 26:06.960
to hit round stones

470
26:06.960 --> 26:08.160
into rabbit holes.

471
26:08.400 --> 26:09.550
It has absolutely nothing

472
26:09.550 --> 26:10.880
to do with aristocrats.

473
26:19.610 --> 26:20.210
By the way,

474
26:20.640 --> 26:21.980
when I arrived, I saw

475
26:22.140 --> 26:23.590
a Western-style oil painting of

476
26:23.590 --> 26:25.570
a ball at the Sudanese royal palace

477
26:25.570 --> 26:27.200
hanging in the center of the lobby.

478
26:27.200 --> 26:28.600
You have a good eye, miss.

479
26:29.010 --> 26:30.510
I picked it out myself.

480
26:30.660 --> 26:32.320
It just got hung up yesterday.

481
26:32.380 --> 26:33.380
What do you think?

482
26:33.460 --> 26:36.070
The people in that painting are dressed luxuriously,

483
26:36.070 --> 26:37.380
dancing to their hearts' content.

484
26:37.380 --> 26:39.180
But what it really depicts

485
26:39.270 --> 26:41.270
are assassins hiding in the shadows,

486
26:41.270 --> 26:42.610
which symbolizes danger.

487
26:42.610 --> 26:44.870
If a guest who understands art sees it...

488
26:46.610 --> 26:48.740
I'm afraid it might be inappropriate.

489
26:48.980 --> 26:50.310
So that's what it means.

490
26:52.550 --> 26:53.850
Thank you for the reminder, miss.

491
26:53.850 --> 26:56.180
I'll have someone take it down right away.

492
27:02.460 --> 27:03.250
Miss Ye.

493
27:04.700 --> 27:05.430
Please wait.

494
27:08.960 --> 27:10.270
You are?

495
27:12.480 --> 27:13.680
My friends flatter me

496
27:14.250 --> 27:15.650
by calling me Master Jin.

497
27:15.850 --> 27:17.160
I'm the boss here.

498
27:17.740 --> 27:18.250
I just heard

499
27:18.250 --> 27:20.180
you speak very elegantly, Miss Ye.

500
27:20.270 --> 27:21.980
I would like to hire you, Miss Ye,

501
27:21.980 --> 27:23.440
to try some clerical work.

502
27:24.250 --> 27:25.850
I wonder if you'd be willing?

503
27:26.270 --> 27:27.070
I would be!

504
27:27.750 --> 27:28.880
To be honest,

505
27:29.070 --> 27:30.570
I really need this job.

506
27:31.090 --> 27:31.750
Master Jin.

507
27:33.460 --> 27:34.940
Fifth Young Master Yu wants to dance all night.

508
27:34.940 --> 27:37.000
We are short of hands in the Lido Hall.

509
27:38.180 --> 27:40.660
Transfer some people from Yongan Hall first.

510
27:40.660 --> 27:42.390
I'm going to Shenyang tonight.

511
27:43.110 --> 27:44.980
Tell the foreman to keep a close eye on things.

512
27:44.980 --> 27:45.510
Yes, Sir.

513
27:49.810 --> 27:51.480
If Miss Ye has time tonight,

514
27:52.380 --> 27:53.910
you can also go and help out.

515
27:54.050 --> 27:55.850
Fifth Young Master Yu's parties

516
27:55.900 --> 27:56.720
pay very well.

517
27:57.830 --> 27:58.500
I can do it.

518
27:58.740 --> 28:00.000
Thank you, Master Jin.

519
28:41.070 --> 28:42.850
Then I'll be looking forward to it.

520
28:42.850 --> 28:45.050
Second Young Lady Tao, let me toast you.

521
28:46.980 --> 28:48.250
Tao Ziyi?

522
28:48.860 --> 28:50.380
[Tao Ziyi]

523
28:49.850 --> 28:51.310
Who drew this?

524
28:50.380 --> 28:54.550
[Ye Pingjun]

525
28:52.160 --> 28:53.530
Look at what's drawn here.

526
28:53.530 --> 28:54.530
It's so funny.

527
28:54.550 --> 28:55.810
[Recognition for Outstanding Students]

528
28:55.510 --> 28:56.380
Serves her right.

529
28:56.380 --> 28:57.350
What qualifications does Ye Pingjun have

530
28:57.350 --> 29:00.210
to be rated as a grade-A student along with Tao Ziyi?

531
29:15.480 --> 29:16.900
I heard you really

532
29:16.900 --> 29:18.380
went all out today.

533
29:18.440 --> 29:20.110
That's impressive.

534
29:21.420 --> 29:22.610
You bought that necklace today

535
29:22.610 --> 29:24.470
for Second Young Lady Tao, right?

536
29:25.550 --> 29:26.280
Make a guess.

537
29:26.420 --> 29:27.310
Again?

538
29:30.530 --> 29:32.190
You were very attentive to her

539
29:32.250 --> 29:33.770
a while ago.

540
29:34.980 --> 29:35.850
But recently,

541
29:35.850 --> 29:38.220
you've been acting hot and cold toward her.

542
29:38.220 --> 29:39.000
I guess...

543
29:40.680 --> 29:41.270
Either

544
29:41.500 --> 29:43.030
you are playing hard to get,

545
29:43.200 --> 29:44.200
or

546
29:44.680 --> 29:46.210
you have other intentions.

547
29:52.980 --> 29:53.960
Li Boren.

548
29:55.110 --> 29:56.480
You have many flaws,

549
29:57.320 --> 29:58.850
but your biggest one

550
30:00.310 --> 30:01.710
is that you talk too much.

551
30:01.980 --> 30:02.610
Got it.

552
30:04.380 --> 30:05.790
Talk less.

553
30:20.180 --> 30:22.290
Why didn't Fifth Young Master ask you to dance?

554
30:22.290 --> 30:23.890
I don't care if he does or not.

555
30:24.480 --> 30:26.090
When he danced with you a while back,

556
30:26.090 --> 30:28.220
it felt like you two were inseparable.

557
30:28.920 --> 30:31.850
Suddenly, he turned his back and played with others.

558
30:33.980 --> 30:34.750
Ziyi.

559
30:35.460 --> 30:36.960
I must remind you,

560
30:37.850 --> 30:39.780
he has countless female admirers.

561
30:39.880 --> 30:41.610
He won't be not easy to control.

562
30:41.980 --> 30:43.440
You should pull out early.

563
30:43.920 --> 30:45.350
Don't fall too deep.

564
30:47.660 --> 30:49.720
It's not clear who will fall for whom.

565
30:51.350 --> 30:52.200
Sister,

566
30:52.700 --> 30:54.160
you don't understand men,

567
30:54.250 --> 30:56.660
especially men like Yu Changxuan.

568
30:59.000 --> 30:59.960
Don't worry.

569
31:00.460 --> 31:01.860
The night is still young.

570
31:27.850 --> 31:28.660
Miss.

571
31:29.330 --> 31:30.530
May I have this dance?

572
31:31.000 --> 31:32.000
It'll be my honor.

573
31:44.310 --> 31:48.110
[Xiangxi Hotel]

574
31:50.720 --> 31:51.740
After dinner,

575
31:51.760 --> 31:53.010
I'll have someone take you home.

576
31:53.010 --> 31:53.420
Okay.

577
32:40.030 --> 32:41.310
Fifth Young Master Yu made quite a splash

578
32:41.310 --> 32:42.380
at the auction.

579
32:42.680 --> 32:43.880
I wonder which beauty

580
32:43.880 --> 32:45.310
will receive the necklace

581
32:45.310 --> 32:47.370
you went to such great lengths to get.

582
32:54.050 --> 32:54.850
The necklace?

583
32:55.770 --> 32:56.770
It's for Jinxuan.

584
32:57.570 --> 32:58.270
Why?

585
32:59.240 --> 33:00.040
Do you like it?

586
33:04.770 --> 33:06.900
I wouldn't dare to claim such an honor.

587
33:07.460 --> 33:08.400
I heard

588
33:08.750 --> 33:09.850
that a few days ago,

589
33:10.110 --> 33:11.530
you bought 10 sets of

590
33:11.680 --> 33:13.380
pure gold hair ornaments

591
33:14.010 --> 33:16.470
for the leading actress of a theater troupe.

592
33:17.050 --> 33:19.380
Yesterday, you booked a whole dance hall.

593
33:19.640 --> 33:22.480
Fifth Young Master Yu has been really busy

594
33:22.680 --> 33:24.280
treating everyone equally.

595
33:27.960 --> 33:30.310
Miss Tao, you are usually so cold and aloof,

596
33:30.310 --> 33:32.310
not even giving me a passing glance.

597
33:33.180 --> 33:34.380
But now, you know my private affairs

598
33:34.380 --> 33:35.840
like the back of your hand.

599
33:37.030 --> 33:38.690
Second Young Lady Tao's heart

600
33:39.740 --> 33:41.250
is truly more unpredictable

601
33:41.250 --> 33:43.050
than the spring breeze in April.

602
34:11.850 --> 34:12.980
Someone's shooting!

603
34:12.980 --> 34:13.570
Ziyi!

604
34:13.880 --> 34:14.460
Ziyi!

605
34:16.080 --> 34:16.679
Run!

606
34:29.110 --> 34:29.909
Go over there!

607
34:42.780 --> 34:43.860
Mom!

608
34:44.670 --> 34:46.130
Mom!

609
34:50.280 --> 34:51.440
Don't be afraid. It's okay.

610
34:51.440 --> 34:52.679
Mom!

611
34:55.880 --> 34:57.080
Close the hall doors!

612
34:57.260 --> 34:58.190
Close the doors!

613
35:31.980 --> 35:32.640
Changxuan.

614
35:33.260 --> 35:35.260
The Tao sisters have been sent away.

615
35:36.440 --> 35:37.570
Where is Master Jin?

616
35:39.110 --> 35:40.670
Master Jin took the evening train

617
35:40.670 --> 35:42.300
to Shenyang for procurement.

618
35:42.300 --> 35:44.190
Call your Master Jin back immediately.

619
35:44.190 --> 35:45.320
He just left,

620
35:45.360 --> 35:46.070
and this Xiangxi Hotel

621
35:46.070 --> 35:47.670
becomes riddled with holes.

622
35:48.340 --> 35:49.480
Fifth Young Master Yu.

623
35:49.480 --> 35:50.320
If you ask me,

624
35:50.550 --> 35:51.650
we should arrest them all

625
35:51.650 --> 35:53.580
and interrogate them thoroughly.

626
35:54.360 --> 35:55.620
Search them one by one.

627
35:56.090 --> 35:56.750
-Yes. -Yes.

628
36:07.690 --> 36:09.550
See who has a silver fountain pen.

629
36:10.010 --> 36:11.270
A silver fountain pen?

630
36:11.710 --> 36:12.460
The killers all had

631
36:12.460 --> 36:14.130
silver fountain pens on their chests.

632
36:14.130 --> 36:14.820
It should be a mark

633
36:14.820 --> 36:16.350
to identify accomplices.

634
36:18.900 --> 36:20.040
Indeed.

635
36:33.690 --> 36:35.690
There's a silver fountain pen here.

636
36:37.570 --> 36:38.230
Don't move!

637
36:41.170 --> 36:42.540
This pen isn't mine.

638
37:18.760 --> 37:19.900
It's you.

639
37:23.460 --> 37:24.400
You know her?

640
37:27.030 --> 37:28.960
Take her back to the headquarters.

641
37:29.920 --> 37:31.850
I'll interrogate her personally.

642
38:11.280 --> 38:12.670
Come, Miss Ye.

643
38:14.070 --> 38:15.470
Let's begin officially.

644
38:22.380 --> 38:26.160
[Nanhuai Army Headquarters]

645
38:36.000 --> 38:36.600
Enough.

646
38:40.150 --> 38:42.810
This is our headquarter's interrogation room.

647
38:44.050 --> 38:45.630
We are very thorough with our hospitality.

648
38:45.630 --> 38:47.890
Are you still refusing to tell the truth?

649
38:48.500 --> 38:50.150
I'm telling the truth.

650
38:50.340 --> 38:52.000
I went for an interview this afternoon.

651
38:52.000 --> 38:52.860
They were short-handed,

652
38:52.860 --> 38:54.000
so I was transferred there.

653
38:54.000 --> 38:56.060
You can check if you don't believe me.

654
38:56.230 --> 38:59.760
You're not likeable when you're not sincere in a conversation.

655
39:01.920 --> 39:04.120
Do you see that meat grinder over there?

656
39:04.650 --> 39:05.070
Come,

657
39:07.050 --> 39:08.260
put your hand in.

658
39:09.070 --> 39:10.200
Once the power is on,

659
39:11.130 --> 39:12.550
soon there will be nothing left

660
39:12.550 --> 39:14.610
but crushed bones and mangled flesh.

661
39:15.440 --> 39:17.370
Have you ever had cupping therapy?

662
39:21.440 --> 39:22.190
Tell me,

663
39:23.300 --> 39:25.230
who is the mastermind behind this?

664
39:26.340 --> 39:27.940
This is your last chance.

665
39:29.570 --> 39:31.260
I really don't know.

666
39:40.980 --> 39:41.880
Ye Pingjun.

667
39:42.260 --> 39:44.520
Class 3, Grade 2 of Mingde Girls' School.

668
39:44.780 --> 39:47.150
You live in Tianshuijing Alley in the east of the city.

669
39:47.150 --> 39:48.670
You only have your mother at home,

670
39:48.670 --> 39:49.980
who has a chronic lung disease.

671
39:49.980 --> 39:52.150
She goes to Ren'ai Hospital for consultations every month.

672
39:52.150 --> 39:54.010
Her attending doctor is Wang Zhiyuan.

673
39:54.010 --> 39:55.320
She has been treated for three years.

674
39:55.320 --> 39:56.610
Her condition has improved,

675
39:56.610 --> 39:57.210
but

676
39:57.630 --> 39:59.960
she still falls ill whenever it gets cold.

677
39:59.960 --> 40:00.480
Right?

678
40:05.510 --> 40:06.860
What do you want to do?

679
40:08.170 --> 40:09.000
What I want to do

680
40:09.000 --> 40:10.360
is already very clear.

681
40:10.760 --> 40:12.820
As long as you name your accomplices,

682
40:13.380 --> 40:14.440
I will be lenient

683
40:14.440 --> 40:15.630
and let you go home.

684
40:17.300 --> 40:19.760
Your mother is still waiting for you at home.

685
40:25.980 --> 40:26.940
Calm down.

686
40:28.590 --> 40:29.920
I must calm down.

687
40:32.960 --> 40:34.960
I remember during the interview...

688
40:40.340 --> 40:41.170
Feng Yao.

689
40:42.090 --> 40:43.170
What a coincidence.

690
40:43.170 --> 40:45.100
Are you here for the interview too?

691
40:48.500 --> 40:50.960
When the interview results were announced,

692
40:51.460 --> 40:53.320
she wasn't among those accepted.

693
40:54.210 --> 40:55.700
But during the ball,

694
40:56.340 --> 40:57.280
why was she wearing

695
40:57.280 --> 40:58.410
a waiter's uniform?

696
41:01.150 --> 41:02.410
Fifth Young Master Yu.

697
41:03.710 --> 41:04.850
I have a proposal.

698
41:07.460 --> 41:08.550
A proposal?

699
41:08.950 --> 41:09.380
Yes.

700
41:13.320 --> 41:14.120
Let's hear it.

701
41:17.760 --> 41:18.780
Let me out.

702
41:19.230 --> 41:20.170
Within ten days,

703
41:21.440 --> 41:22.090
I will catch the real culprit

704
41:22.090 --> 41:23.710
who framed me.

705
41:34.010 --> 41:35.570
I didn't expect you to still be in the mood

706
41:35.570 --> 41:36.380
to joke with me.

707
41:36.380 --> 41:37.710
I'm not joking with you.

708
41:38.550 --> 41:39.960
Since Fifth Young Master Yu has investigated

709
41:39.960 --> 41:41.050
so thoroughly

710
41:41.420 --> 41:42.480
and knows I have a

711
41:42.480 --> 41:43.670
bedridden mother at home,

712
41:43.670 --> 41:45.600
it's impossible for me to run away.

713
41:46.190 --> 41:47.010
Within ten days,

714
41:47.010 --> 41:48.870
if I really can't find the person,

715
41:49.110 --> 41:51.640
it won't be too late for you to arrest me again.

716
41:52.050 --> 41:53.310
Fifth Young Master Yu.

717
41:54.760 --> 41:55.980
Do you dare to bet with me?
